### **Section 1: Mantra Word-Meaning &amp; 24 Akshar (मन्त्र अर्थ एवं २४ अक्षर)**

**Q1: Gayatri Mantra ke har ek shabd ka WhatsApp-style simplified meaning kya hai?**

* **Ans:**
  * **Om (ॐ):** God / Eternal Sound (Param-Brahma).
  * **Bhooh (भूः):** Life-force / Dukh door karne wala.
  * **Bhuvah (भुवः):** Sabhi klesh aur tensions ko khatam karne wala.
  * **Swah (स्वः):** Sachha anand aur peace dene wala.
  * **Tat (तत्):** Voh God.
  * **Savituh (सवितुः):** Sun jaisa bright aur sabko create karne wala.
  * **Varenyam (वरेण्यम्):** Sabse best / accept karne yogya.
  * **Bhargah (भर्गः):** Sins aur negativity ko burn karne wala.
  * **Devasya (देवस्य):** Divine God ka.
  * **Dheemahi (धीमहि):** Hum apne andar dharan / meditate karte hain.
  * **Dhiyo (धियो):** Intellect / Buddhi.
  * **Yo (यो):** Jo.
  * **Nah (नः):** Humari.
  * **Prachodayat (प्रचोदयात्):** Right path pe inspire kare.

**Q2: Gayatri Mantra ke 24 akshar human body se kaise connected hain?**

* **Ans:** Body me 24 subtle nerve glands (**Yogic Granthiyan**) hoti hain. Mantra bolte waqt tongue aur mouth ki vibrations in glands ko strike karti hain, jisse gupt shaktiyan awaken ho jaati hain.

